Crossport

a Simple, Lightweight Tool for Generating Crossfiles.


Hey There, if you are ever gonna build windows in linux make sure to use xwin not mingw

I had Problems with exporting MingW, so i used Xwin. Make sure to put your xwin folder in here

/Home/YOURUSER/.xwin <-- This should be your xwin folder

if you are gonna build crossport in X86, i wanna let you know its untested.

And Make sure when you are Building Crossport, atleast have LDC Compiler installed in your system.

BUT, if you are not willing to build crossport make sure to just use the precompiled releases.

dependencies: LDC Compiler version 1.4.0 , clang ,clang++,